docs/plans/agent-id-readback/review/sol-consult-plan6.log-1493-./docs/plans/casey-doctor/proposed/GRILL.md:86:- **关键涟漪：`doctor` 须进 `cli-mcp-face` 的 `EXCLUDED` 白名单**。`doctor` 是自检类命令、非「测试消费者该驱动的能力」，同 `selftest`/`breaker`/`contract`/`help` 不进 `MCP` 面。`mcp-parity` 契约（`docs/plans/mcp-parity/`，尚在 proposed）拟加「`CLI` 命令集 − `EXCLUDED` ⊆ `MCP` 工具集」覆盖断言；**若该断言先落地**，新加 `case 'doctor':` 而不把 `doctor` 加进 `EXCLUDED`，会让 `cli-mcp-face` 金牌红（fail-closed 正确行为）。故本契约实现时须把 `doctor` 加进 `EXCLUDED = {help,breaker,contract,heal}` → `{help,breaker,contract,heal,doctor}`，并同步 `EXPECT_TOOL_NAMES`/覆盖断言不新增 `casey_doctor` 工具。两契约落地先后任意，交账在此显式挂钩。
docs/plans/agent-id-readback/review/sol-consult-plan6.log-1494-./docs/plans/casey-doctor/proposed/GRILL.md:89:- **无新造词**：`就绪自检`/`跨平台` 是平白描述、`route:human`/`fail-safe`/`hermetic`/`通道剖面` 均已在 `CONTEXT.md` 登记；`doctor` 是命令名、非新术语。写入前跑 `term-lint`。
