docs/plans/p9-tier2-live-smoke/plan-codex-r2-delta.log:2576:docs/plans/p9-tier2-live-smoke/plan-codex-r1.log:4319:docs/plans/real-uat-attestation/review/codex-review-r1.log:100:- **fail-safe 不 fail-open**：机器只终判 `PASS` 与有取证背书的 `SUT_DEFECT`；证不出的一律 `NEEDS_HUMAN`，写 Inbox 等人裁。绝不默认成「可自愈」或自动记缺陷。
docs/plans/p9-tier2-live-smoke/plan-codex-r2-delta.log:2577:docs/plans/p9-tier2-live-smoke/plan-codex-r1.log:4320:docs/plans/real-uat-attestation/review/codex-review-r1.log:101:- **完成是退出码，不是声明**：报告里「通过/失败」必须来自真实回放 + `verdict.json`，别拿「文件存在」或桩命令（exit 3）当通过。
docs/plans/p9-tier2-live-smoke/plan-codex-r2-delta.log:2578:docs/plans/p9-tier2-live-smoke/plan-codex-r1.log:4321:docs/plans/real-uat-attestation/review/codex-review-r1.log:109:| `SUT_DEFECT` 被测缺陷 | 动作做对了、断言硬失败、且有取证背书（5xx/pageerror/crash/错误信封） | **被测系统**（真 bug，出缺陷单给研发） |
docs/plans/p9-tier2-live-smoke/plan-codex-r2-delta.log:2579:docs/plans/p9-tier2-live-smoke/plan-codex-r1.log:4322:docs/plans/real-uat-attestation/review/codex-review-r1.log:114:「测试用例的错误」≈ `CASE_DEFECT`；「测试步骤/工装的错误」≈ `HARNESS_ERROR`；「被测系统的错误」= `SUT_DEFECT`。三者落点不同，绝不能都报成「失败」了事。
docs/plans/p9-tier2-live-smoke/plan-codex-r2-delta.log:2580:docs/plans/p9-tier2-live-smoke/plan-codex-r1.log:4323:docs/plans/real-uat-attestation/review/codex-review-r1.log:129:| 相3 确定性回放 | `node bin/casey.mjs replay --events <f> --sut <url> --expected <f> --profile <f> --out <axes.json>`（未签契约拒回放） |
docs/plans/p9-tier2-live-smoke/plan-codex-r2-delta.log:2581:docs/plans/p9-tier2-live-smoke/plan-codex-r1.log:4324:docs/plans/real-uat-attestation/review/codex-review-r1.log:142:- 结论：`PASS=n / SUT_DEFECT=n / HARNESS_ERROR=n / NEEDS_HUMAN=n`。
docs/plans/p9-tier2-live-smoke/plan-codex-r2-delta.log:2582:docs/plans/p9-tier2-live-smoke/plan-codex-r1.log:4325:docs/plans/real-uat-attestation/review/codex-review-r1.log:143:- 0 error：只有 `SUT_DEFECT=0`、`HARNESS_ERROR=0`、`NEEDS_HUMAN=0` 且每步都是 `PASS` 才能说 0 error。
