./docs/plans/p9-tier2-live-smoke/code-codex-r3.log:3025:docs/plans/p9-tier2-live-smoke/plan-codex-r2-delta.log-1921-docs/plans/casey-doctor/proposed/GRILL.md:29:**建议级（advisory，`warn`，不驱动退出码）**——缺了不挡 hermetic 就绪、只降质量或只真机才需：
./docs/plans/p9-tier2-live-smoke/code-codex-r3.log:3026:docs/plans/p9-tier2-live-smoke/plan-codex-r2-delta.log-1922-docs/plans/casey-doctor/proposed/GRILL.md:32:6. `site.json` 在位 + 形态（只查存在性/浅形态，绝不读值，见 D5）：缺 → `warn`，`hint` 指 `README.md` 凭据节。理由：`site.json` 只真机 tier-2 才需，hermetic 用户合法地没有它。
./docs/plans/p9-tier2-live-smoke/code-codex-r3.log:3027:docs/plans/p9-tier2-live-smoke/plan-codex-r2-delta.log:1923:docs/plans/casey-doctor/proposed/GRILL.md:37:8. 隧道就绪：只探 `site.json.target.devProxyUrl` 的**回环端口**（形如 `127.0.0.1:15519`，回环基址非敏感，`README.md:49` 已定性）在不在听 + 耗时，镜像 `scripts/win-probe-target.mjs` 只回状态码先例。`status = route-human`：端口在听只证「本地隧道监听器起了」，「端到端经隧道到真站通」须真隧道 + Steven 在场（审计 R1/R3 家族），是本命令的 route:human 尾巴，**不进退出码**。探针绝不碰 `target.startUrl`。
./docs/plans/p9-tier2-live-smoke/code-codex-r3.log:3028:docs/plans/p9-tier2-live-smoke/plan-codex-r2-delta.log-1924-docs/plans/casey-doctor/proposed/GRILL.md:39:## D3 退出码语义：就绪级驱动，建议/`route:human` 级不阻塞
./docs/plans/p9-tier2-live-smoke/code-codex-r3.log:3029:docs/plans/p9-tier2-live-smoke/plan-codex-r2-delta.log-1925-docs/plans/casey-doctor/proposed/GRILL.md:42:- **退出码**：`0` 当且仅当就绪级（D2 第 1–4 项）全 `ok`；任一就绪级 `fail` → `1`。`warn` 与 `route-human` 逐行列出带 `hint`，但**绝不翻退出码**。
./docs/plans/p9-tier2-live-smoke/code-codex-r3.log:3030:docs/plans/p9-tier2-live-smoke/plan-codex-r2-delta.log-1926-docs/plans/casey-doctor/proposed/GRILL.md:43:- 「不阻塞」的两层意思：① doctor 绝不接进阶段互锁/gate/hook——非零退出纯信息、不挡任何下游动作；② 建议级/`route:human` 级缺失不把退出码翻红，故一台装齐 node+playwright+chromium 但没真机凭据/隧道的 hermetic 开发机能拿到 exit 0、逐项就绪级 `ok`。
./docs/plans/p9-tier2-live-smoke/code-codex-r3.log:3031:docs/plans/p9-tier2-live-smoke/plan-codex-r2-delta.log-1927-docs/plans/casey-doctor/proposed/GRILL.md:44:- 为何建议级不驱动退出码（**推荐默认，grill 可翻**）：doctor 的 exit 0 承诺 =「hermetic 回放就绪」。真机凭据/隧道天然 route:human、字体缺只降截图可读性——拿这些去惩罚一台合法的纯 hermetic 装机、逼它永远 exit 1，既不准确也让人学会无视退出码（信号自毁，护栏 #14 精神）。审计「缺项非零并列清单」的要求在**就绪级**面足额兑现。
./docs/plans/p9-tier2-live-smoke/code-codex-r3.log:3032:docs/plans/p9-tier2-live-smoke/plan-codex-r2-delta.log-1928-docs/plans/casey-doctor/proposed/GRILL.md:56:## D5 凭据/`site.json` 只查存在性与形态，绝不读内容
./docs/plans/p9-tier2-live-smoke/code-codex-r3.log:3033:docs/plans/p9-tier2-live-smoke/plan-codex-r2-delta.log-1929-docs/plans/casey-doctor/proposed/GRILL.md:58:- 三态：`在位` / `缺失` / `形态不符`。判法：`fs.existsSync` → `JSON.parse` 成功 → 顶层**键名**在（`site.json` 查 `target.startUrl`/`target.devProxyUrl` 键名；`credentials.json` 查 `user`/`pass` 键名）。**只看键名在不在、绝不把任何值取进变量或输出。**
