8327:- [Medium] [附件集合](/mnt/d/ctx/heren/casey/lib/selftest-tier2-projection.mjs:17)明确排除了 `video.json/video.webm`，与真机正式交付必须含录屏的[运行手册要求](/mnt/d/ctx/heren/casey/docs/runbooks/real-uat-runbook.md:92)不一致；缺录像仍可算管线完成。
